                <mxCell id="n_138" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#C2410C;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1;align=center;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;CAPA C: EXPERIMENTACIÓN, PROTOCOLO TEMPORAL WALK-FORWARD &amp; MODELOS BASE (NIVEL 0)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="28" width="690" x="75" y="766" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_139" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #C2410C; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #EA580C; padding-bottom: 3px;&quot;&gt;📅 C.1 Validación Walk-Forward (12 Bloques 2025)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Ventana de Entrenamiento:&lt;/b&gt; 6 meses continuos rodantes (180 días).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Purga Obligatoria de 5 Días:&lt;/b&gt; Brecha ciega de seguridad ($t$ a $t+5$).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Bloque de Evaluación Fuera de Muestra:&lt;/b&gt; 1 mes calendario evaluado día a día.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="430" x="90" y="815" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_140" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #C2410C; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #EA580C; padding-bottom: 3px;&quot;&gt;⚖️ C.2 Submuestreo Balanceado 1:1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• Tasa base natural desbalanceada (11% a 37%).&lt;br/&gt;• Submuestreo aleatorio de la clase mayoritaria (negativos) a 1:1 en entrenamiento.&lt;br/&gt;• $N=100,000$ filas/bloque para convergencia rápida y estabilidad numérica.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="410" x="550" y="815" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_141" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FDBA74;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #C2410C; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #EA580C; padding-bottom: 3px;&quot;&gt;📐 C.3 Calibración Analítica de Priors (Dal Pozzolo)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 3px 0; background: #FFF7ED; padding: 3px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10.5px;&quot;&gt;$$\text{logit}(P_{\text{real}}) = \text{logit}(P_{\text{sub}}) - \ln(\beta), \quad \beta = \frac{\bar{y}_{\text{entreno}}}{\bar{y}_{\text{real}}}$$&lt;/div&gt;• Restaura la calibración real del mercado en evaluación sin alterar el ranking (AUC idéntico).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="460" x="990" y="815" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_142" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C7D2FE;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #4338CA; font-size: 11.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C7D2FE; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;🌲 CatBoost Classifier&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.35;&quot;&gt;• Oblivious trees simétricos&lt;br/&gt;• Target encoding dinámico&lt;br/&gt;• AUC: 0.7328 | Brier: 0.1039&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Líder Top 100: 61.87%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="260" x="90" y="975" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_143" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C7D2FE;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #4338CA; font-size: 11.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C7D2FE; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;⚡ LightGBM Classifier&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.35;&quot;&gt;• Crecimiento leaf-wise en bins&lt;br/&gt;• Ultra-rápido: 0.9s / bloque&lt;br/&gt;• AUC: 0.7326 | p@100: 61.54%&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Líder Brier: 0.1037&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="260" x="370" y="975" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_144" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C7D2FE;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #4338CA; font-size: 11.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C7D2FE; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;🚀 XGBoost Classifier&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.35;&quot;&gt;• Regularización analítica L1/L2&lt;br/&gt;• Máxima discriminación global&lt;br/&gt;• Brier: 0.1040 | p@100: 61.70%&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Líder AUC: 0.7333&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="260" x="650" y="975" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_145" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C7D2FE;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=6;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #4338CA; font-size: 11.5px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C7D2FE; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;🌳 Random Forest (Bagging)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.35;&quot;&gt;• Ensamble 200 árboles ortogonales&lt;br/&gt;• Reducción de varianza y ruido&lt;br/&gt;• AUC: 0.7282 | p@100: 61.00%&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Brier Score: 0.1037&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="260" x="930" y="975" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_146" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A5B4FC;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #4338CA; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #6366F1; padding-bottom: 3px;&quot;&gt;🔢 C.4 Vector de Predicciones Nivel 0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• Matriz de salida: $\mathbf{P}_t = [P_{\text{Cat}}, P_{\text{Lgb}}, P_{\text{Xgb}}, P_{\text{RF}}] \in [0, 1]^4$.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Diversidad Empírica:&lt;/b&gt; Matriz de correlación Spearman $\rho \in [0.88, 0.94]$.&lt;br/&gt;• Complementariedad de errores confirmada para el meta-aprendizaje.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
