                <mxCell id="n_158" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#6B21A8;strokeColor=#9333EA;strokeWidth=1;align=center;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF;&quot;&gt;CAPA D: META-APRENDIZAJE DE NIVEL 1, APORTE DE TESIS (STJC) &amp; MODEL REGISTRY&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="28" width="690" x="75" y="1216" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_159" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E9D5FF;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #6B21A8; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #9333EA; padding-bottom: 3px;&quot;&gt;🧪 D.1 Espacio de 39 Ensambles (12 Familias)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• Votación Suave, Ponderada, Dura y Rank Averaging.&lt;br/&gt;• Stacking Lineal, Lasso L1, Ridge L2, ElasticNet.&lt;br/&gt;• Stacking No Negativo, Meta-RF, Blending 20%.&lt;br/&gt;• Selección Greedy de Caruana (con y sin calibración).&lt;br/&gt;• Dynamic Selection por Grifo y Mixture of Experts (MoE).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Filtro Multicriterio:&lt;/b&gt; Solo 8 ensambles superaron el 4 de 4.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="175" width="410" x="90" y="1275" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_160" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D8B4FE;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #9333EA; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #6B21A8; font-size: 12.5px;&quot;&gt;🌟 D.2 APORTE NUCLEAR: STJC (Stacking Temporal Jerárquico)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: #F3E8FF; color: #581C87; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Récords 4 de 4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;Multiventana Temporal (3 meses):&lt;/b&gt; Meta-entrenamiento en ventanas históricas purgadas.&lt;br/&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;Restricción Convexa:&lt;/b&gt; $w_i \ge 0, \sum w_i = 1$ (elimina coeficientes negativos inestables).&lt;br/&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;Contracción (Shrinkage $\lambda=0.25$):&lt;/b&gt; Resuelve multicolinealidad extrema hacia pesos uniformes:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 3px 0; background: #FAF5FF; padding: 2px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10.5px;&quot;&gt;$$\mathbf{w}^* = (1 - \lambda) \mathbf{w} + \lambda [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25]^\top$$&lt;/div&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;Ponderación Jerárquica:&lt;/b&gt; Especialización por tipo de combustible.&lt;br/&gt;5. &lt;b&gt;Bagging Temporal:&lt;/b&gt; Promediado de ventanas para mitigación de varianza.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background: #FAF5FF; border: 1px solid #D8B4FE; border-radius: 4px; padding: 3px; margin-top: 3px; font-size: 10.5px; color: #581C87; font-weight: 800; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;🏆 RÉCORDS: p@50 = 70.23% | p@100 = 62.51% | Brier = 0.1031&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="275" width="620" x="530" y="1265" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_161" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D8B4FE;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #9333EA; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #6B21A8; font-size: 12.5px;&quot;&gt;🏆 D.3 Votación Suave (Producción)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background: #F3E8FF; color: #581C87; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Despliegue 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Promedio Simple Parsimonioso:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; margin: 4px 0; background: #FAF5FF; padding: 4px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;$$P_{\text{final}} = \frac{P_{\text{Cat}} + P_{\text{Lgb}} + P_{\text{Xgb}} + P_{\text{RF}}}{4}$$&lt;/div&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Récord Absoluto de AUC: 0.7355&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Cero parámetros a sobreajustar en producción.&lt;br/&gt;• 0 ms de cómputo meta adicional en el batch diario.&lt;br/&gt;• Seleccionado formalmente para operar en 2026.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="220" width="430" x="1180" y="1275" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n_162" parent="1" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#9333EA;strokeWidth=2;shadow=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Segoe UI&#39;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; padding-top: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 800; color: #6B21A8; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;🗄️ Model Registry&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: #334155; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Almacén de Modelos&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Pesos serializados (.joblib)&lt;br/&gt;• Pipelines calibrados&lt;br/&gt;• Versiones y metadatos&lt;br/&gt;• Reentrenamiento trimestral&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
